---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { u } from '../lib/paths';
---

<Base
  title="Admissions"
  description="Apply to the University of Mars for Fall 2027. Deadlines, visits, and tuition for the coming class."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Admissions"
    title="Admissions"
    lede="The class that starts in Fall Semester 2027 is now taking applications. Fall Semester 2026 is already in session."
    crumbs={[{ href: '/admissions/', label: 'Admissions' }]}
  >
    <p class="page-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="#apply">Review how to apply</a>
    </p>
  </PageHero>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h2 id="apply">First-year admission</h2>
    <p>
      First-year applicants for Fall 2027 need the application, a school report, and one academic recommendation. The
      application opened August 1, 2026. Early action closes Monday, November 16, 2026. Regular decision closes Friday,
      January 8, 2027.
    </p>
    <p>
      Aid for students who enroll in Fall 2027 is aid year 2027–28, which is separate from the 2026–27 file used by
      students already here. See the upcoming section on the <a href={u('/financial-aid/#next-year')}>financial aid page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 id="transfer">Transfer admission</h2>
    <p>
      Spring Semester 2027 transfer applications close Monday, November 2, 2026. Fall 2027 transfer applications close
      Monday, March 1, 2027. A transfer credit estimate is sent with the offer, not before.
    </p>

    <h2 id="international">International students</h2>
    <p>
      The same dates apply. After you accept an offer, the international office issues the admissions letter you need
      for a visa appointment. Write to <a href={`mailto:${site.admitEmail}`}>{site.admitEmail}</a> with your applicant ID
      in the subject.
    </p>

    <h2 id="visit">Visit campus</h2>
    <p>
      Fall preview day is Thursday, November 12, 2026. Information sessions start at 9 a.m. in the student union, with
      walking tours of the quad, the library, and one residence hall. Weekday tours continue on most Fridays at 1 p.m.
      Reserve a seat from the admissions office.
    </p>

    <h2 id="tuition">Tuition and fees</h2>
    <p>
      For the current year, 2026–27, undergraduate tuition and fees are $13,940 for residents and $44,210 for
      nonresidents. The 2027–28 rates will be set by the trustees in spring 2027. Housing and meals for a standard
      double are budgeted at $16,480 in 2026–27.
    </p>
    <p>
      Admissions: <a href={site.admitHref}>{site.admitPhone}</a>,
      <a href={`mailto:${site.admitEmail}`}>{site.admitEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
